ARCHITECTURE — PUBLIC vs PROPRIETARY
================================================================================

PUBLIC (in this repository):
  index.html          — renderer shell, Three.js scene, UI, export wrappers
                        No algorithm logic. No surface coordinate math.
                        No GLB encoding. Delegates all computation to core.

PROPRIETARY (distributed separately under commercial license):
  core/engine.js      — the Wave Field Engine core. Contains:
                          WFE_surfCoord()    unified surface coordinate abstraction
                          WFE_ALG            24-algorithm catalog, shared fn() interface
                          WFE_bake()         deterministic frame sampler
                          WFE_buildGLB()     GLTF 2.0 morph-target GLB encoder
                        This file is NOT committed to the public repository.
                        It is the licensed artifact.

The public index.html calls window.WFE.* — the API surface exposed by core/engine.js.
Without core/engine.js the renderer will display an error and the engine will not run.

