NOTE: Three.js GLTFExporter is NOT used. GLB encoding is handled entirely
by WFE_buildGLB() in core/engine.js, which implements the GLTF 2.0 binary
specification directly. This was necessary because GLTFExporter r128 fails
silently when exporting morph-target animations (produces a 15-byte corrupt file).

