MATHEMATICAL PRIOR ART
================================================================================

The wave equations implemented in core/engine.js are prior-art mathematics.
The IP is in the architecture — the unified interface, surface coordinate
abstraction, and morph-target pipeline — not in any individual equation.

References for the mathematical models:
- Gerstner (1809), Rayleigh (1885), Love (1911), Faraday (1831)
- Phillips (1958) — ocean spectrum
- Zabusky & Kruskal (1965) — soliton
- Mandelbrot & Van Ness (1968) — fBm

See docs/ACADEMIC-RECORD.md for full provenance record.

